        "author": "Brennan Hatton",
        "date": "2026-02-22T22:28:35Z",
        "message": "Enhance Permission Profiles tab with cards and tool tags (Issue #10)\n\nReplace simple tab-based profile selector with rich profile cards:\n- Profile cards showing name, description, mode, usage count, tool summaries\n- Default profile badge (blue) with star button to set default\n- Duplicate profile button for quick cloning\n- Tag-style tool selector replacing comma-separated text inputs\n- Click to toggle tools: green=allowed, red=blocked, gray=unset\n- Known tools list (Read, Edit, Write, Glob, Grep, Bash, etc.)\n- Export profiles to JSON file, import from JSON file\n- Selected card highlight with blue border\n- Task usage count per profile\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
        "sha": "a0efdb4"
      }
    },
