        "date": "2026-02-23T00:24:55Z",
        "message": "Initial commit: other-sub-agents skill for Claude Code\n\nOrchestrates local (Ollama) and cloud (Gemini) LLM sub-agents with:\n- Dynamic model discovery across providers\n- Trust score system with EWMA updates and time decay\n- Assessment logging after each interaction\n- Dual-model comparison mode\n- Auto-research for new models via benchmark interpolation\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
        "sha": "0dfb181"
      }
    },
